 *
 * Cart "Estimate Shipping and Tax" box. Stock's inline script calls
 * `require([...])` (a config object here, so it threw on every cart page) and
 * the form is Knockout-only. Replaced with an informational line: checkout
 * calculates real rates once an address is entered, so there's no separate
 * estimator. The collapsible wrapper's dead widget reference is left as is.
 *
 * @var \Magento\Checkout\Block\Cart\Shipping $block
 * @var \Magento\Framework\Escaper $escaper
 */
